                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[i]\"What a piece of junk!\" ~ Luke Skywalker[/i]\r\n\r\nI spent more time fighting DOSBox than the Empire, so I can't recommend this release.\r\n\r\nWhether I used an Xbox controller, mouse, or keyboard, the flying was wildly erratic, even after setting the sensitivity to 1%. The point-and-click shooting sections were okay with a mouse, especially in Rebel Assault II. The live-action cutscenes were cool, and I wish I could've seen more of them, but they aren't worth suffering through the gameplay in its current state.",
